#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:180
msgid "Ethernet Connected ArduPilot Vehicle Example"
msgstr "以太网连接的 ArduPilot 飞行器示例"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:5 065e4f05e82a4b8388d8e7d4a5e4d538
#: 0c44b806ea554577a0b5d53c8f454027 34a583cacf604471a2b7b339f8ef0656
#: 562225e047e2498eb5296b3f91aae1c1 950d8aebf5ca48bfbd95ddaff27ae65a
msgid "Ethernet / Network Setup"
msgstr "以太网/网络设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:7 2055bfa0f84b4203adc7d509871dc66c
#: 281aaea995404e178f468cd5e7d25735 715e8e2535944252a19b365659f11e90
#: c9062fc0b8c74467800c07e79e9c38be e430b12c677b45a5a7858810bbeac835
msgid ""
"ArduPilot 4.5 (and higher) provides a network interface framework to allow "
"local and wide-area network connections. Several later generation "
"autopilots, like Pixhawk6X and CubePilot CubeRed, provide Ethernet MAC "
"interfaces, which allows ArduPilot to connect to vehicle peripherals, data "
"servers, and even the wide area network via IP using transport layer UDP or "
"TCP protocols."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 4.5（及更高版本）提供了网络接口框架，支持本地网络和广域网连接。Pixhawk6X 和 CubePilot CubeRed "
"等新一代飞控提供了以太网 MAC 接口，使 ArduPilot 可通过 UDP 或 TCP 传输层 IP 协议连接飞行器外设、数据服务器，甚至广域网。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:9 48641a0c219947f0b3a8ff703544fa94
#: 5b0bd90a964a4482993cefcb1b52b3dc 5b8b98f096d9439e8c65313bf53cfa10
#: c1aecf4263684e2fa56a7dbc22876a4a c8e5065c280241228bacd0d9037e4266
msgid ""
"In addition, autopilots with H7 based processors can connect to Ethernet "
"over a serial port using PPP (Point-to-Point Protocol), a :ref:`PPP to "
"Ethernet Adapter <common-ethernet-adapters>` and a custom firmware build.  "
"See the :ref:`PPP Configuration section <ppp-config>` below for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"此外，搭载 H7 处理器的飞控还可通过串口使用 PPP（点对点协议）、:ref:`PPP 转以太网适配器 <common-ethernet-"
"adapters>` 和自定义固件来连接以太网。详情请参阅下方的 :ref:`PPP 配置章节 <ppp-config>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:11 515caa208af64a3ea63ea890c7b796b4
#: ca8910abfc544197b97d2521162163c2 d43787d9d0954c2a8e016ffb2c69202e
#: e87d0c9c7b4242d98678d6a60a5232d2 fde1b8cf43ba43638ce7492e3b115d3a
msgid ""
"Currently, hooks into the normal serial manager within ArduPilot now allow "
"serial protocols not only to be connected to the autopilot via the normal "
"UART connections, but also via network connections. These can be used either"
" with Etnernet or PPP interfaces."
msgstr ""
"目前，ArduPilot 内部串口管理器的钩子机制使得串口协议不仅可以通过常规 UART 连接接入飞控，也可以通过网络连接接入，可与以太网或 PPP "
"接口配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:13 133f486c2e3b4cf9aaa5a170c9010f3a
#: 864d56f098c845bfa3cb71eaa60a0db8 ac32363264f447e695dba3914251ee91
#: d010aabb57794cf4844ab0c07acd8dfd f775411a581943549d6714c46737d38a
msgid ""
"In addition, LUA Scripting bindings allow the autopilot to run network "
"server type applications via LUA scripts. A web server LUA example is "
"available as an applet that allows faster log downloads, as well as "
"vehicle/system status data to be presented."
msgstr ""
"此外，LUA 脚本绑定允许飞控通过 LUA 脚本运行网络服务器类型的应用程序。一个 Web 服务器 LUA "
"示例作为应用模块提供，支持更快的日志下载以及飞行器/系统状态数据展示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:15 66a87fc4a5c547d1bab2f68bd4986e31
#: 8008d9b8759c4ab1a4d62ce10c9977b6 8bbc9486aded41f7aab27434f9749d48
#: 9e0e5a96238249eda20a2601e16a5d00 cb18ee6769b240438f14b40d0405de7f
msgid ""
"For peripherals with a network interface ArduPilot has AP_Periph firmware "
"that allows the easy development of network peripheral devices using the "
"peripheral's Serial or DroneCAN interfaces to the peripheral device and an "
"easily set up means to pass those devices' data to the autopilot over the "
"network."
msgstr ""
"对于具有网络接口的外设，ArduPilot 提供了 AP_Periph 固件，可利用外设的串口或 DroneCAN "
"接口轻松开发网络外设设备，并通过网络将设备数据传递给飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:18 08718c08b1904abaa2e9e4697bbfa59e
#: 1db943681c374dcf9a7adbea83ccb81a 218dadbf75bb4c7594a25fa9938e0f9c
#: 444c2c215e2747968ed04680be3f94fa 5be4cffa6fe14361b0fcd2aaa2557eb4
msgid "ArduPilot Network Framework Overview"
msgstr "ArduPilot 网络框架概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:20 5c27dfb098cf4e97a99f5796e96e2197
