#: ee0efd12e38f45628b25dc3f935ac53c f2bb2c9dbae44f6685cf289bcc822c8e
msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides a NET manager facility that provides the IP protocol "
"engine, as well as UDP and TCP transport layer engines. Four configurable IP"
" ports are available, and each one can be a UDP or TCP, Client or Server. "
"Data flow to/from these ports can be used by the autopilot as if the data "
"streams were those of a:"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 提供 NET 管理器，包含 IP 协议引擎以及 UDP 和 TCP 传输层引擎。提供四个可配置的 IP 端口，每个端口均可设置为 "
"UDP 或 TCP 的客户端或服务器模式。这些端口的数据流可被飞控像以下设备的数据流一样使用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-network.rst:22 01ecb83a77da4c75946ab955060ab54d
